# Mark code-generator output as generated so GitHub collapses it in pull
# request diffs and excludes it from language statistics. These files are
# produced by `make codegen-update` and `make openapigen-update` from the
# types in pkg/apis/; review the types, not the output.
**/zz_generated*.go linguist-generated=true
**/generated.openapi.go linguist-generated=true
pkg/client/** linguist-generated=true
